WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:14.519
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and since his
last vow left us with so many big questions

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:15.910
I wanted to do another Q&amp;A video.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:20.169
The good news is that they’ve already started
working on series 4 and they know where things

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:21.750
are headed in series 5.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.910
So there will be plenty more sherlock coming
in the next couple of years.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.680
Also heads up, I’m going to be doing weekly
Musketeers videos starting sunday.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.180
It stars peter capaldi from doctor who.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.120
So it’s going to be a lot of fun.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.230
Just like my episode 2 Q&amp;A I picked 20 of
your questions.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:40.970
Since this is mostly just an episode 3 video
I’m holding all your series 4 questions

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:45.980
for a different Q&amp;A later this week.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.280
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:56.260
Careful for spoilers for episode 3 in case
you haven’t seen the episode yet.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.079
Mind palace time, let’s go.

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:02.440
Question number 1 - Chaos Thao asks, were
janine and sherlock just using each other

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.830
or did she believe sherlock’s lies?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.680
She sold their stories to the tabloids and
made a bunch of money, so I think she didn’t

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.940
know sherlock was lying to her.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:15.740
She also disabled his morphine, just out of
spite.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:20.299
Question 2 - Stephanie Vicente asks, did sherlock
know that magnussen was CAM from the wedding

00:01:20.299 --> 00:01:22.500
telegraph before he learned mary’s secret?

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:27.450
No, he probably didn’t figure it out until
after he landed in the hospital and started

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.479
piecing together mary’s secret.

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:32.970
Question 3 - Fangirl 1502 asks what is up
with everyone talking about a third holmes

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:33.970
brother?

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:35.680
So mycroft has this line during the christmas
scenes where he refers to the “other one”.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.720
He could have just been referring to the dog,
but a lot of people think he was talking about

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:40.720
another holmes brother.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:44.020
If he was talking about another brother it
would imply that he is died at some point

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:52.570
in their past.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:57.049
Question 4 - Ivy He Asks, could you rank all
favorite sherlock episodes?

00:01:57.049 --> 00:02:03.119
Right now I’d say in order of most favorite
to least, scandal, sign of three, Reichenbach,

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:09.140
great game, last vow, empty hearse, study
in pink, baskerville and blind banker.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:14.560
Question 5 - Gvantsa Basilia asks do you think
Moriarty is still alive?

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.050
yes and no.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:20.260
The person you saw shoot himself on the rooftop
in Reichenbach is dead.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:24.240
I’m saving a lot of the moriarty talk for
my series 4 video this week.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.800
Question 6 - Filip Ratkovic asks what was
your funniest moment?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:33.580
I would say when sherlock and mycroft got
caught smoking by their mother.

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:38.850
Question 7 - Brooke Hester asks, did you think
the goodbye scene was too cold?

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.870
I think that Watson was ready to get on with
his life.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:45.820
He’d already made peace with mary’s deception,
so he wasn’t holding on to any more anger.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:46.820
And he got a proper goodbye this time.

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.240
He didn’t have to watch sherlock fall out
of the plane or anything.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.080
And remember that they’re classic british
characters, which means that they wouldn’t

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.300
show a lot of outward emotion.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:56.650
That’s why the hug during the wedding was
such a huge deal.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.550
Question 8 - Caroline guess asks How do you
think they will bring moriarty back?

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:11.000
I actually have a very detailed theory I want
to save for my series 4 video, all I say now

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.290
is that “There is another skywalker”.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.780
If you get my meaning.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:20.690
Question 9 - michaelmerc99 asks who’s a
better villain, moriarty or magnussen

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:27.250
I liked Andrew Scott’s performance more,
but if this were real life Magnussen would

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.940
be the more successful villain.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.030
Even mycroft says that he protecting him just
because he’s been useful to the government

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:35.530
in the past and he never goes after anyone
to important.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:39.040
Question 10 - Blake Hutton asks do you think
sherlock being a murderer got out or do you

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.640
think the government covered it up?

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.580
I definitely think the government covered
it up.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:46.760
Remember that line of mycroft’s, england
will always need sherlock holmes.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:51.230
So they dealt with it by sending him on that
really dangerous mission before the events

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.970
of the post credits scene happened.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:58.140
Question 11 - Cam Edwards asks did you expect
sherlock to do what he did at the end?

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.690
how else could he have resolved the plot?

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.480
I was surprised by what happened.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.010
But right before he did it he said high functioning
sociopath, so I think that all of that emotion

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.010
and gushiness we saw from him in the first
two episodes was a facade.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.940
He was fulfilling his “last vow” the best
way he could think of.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.570
The only alternative would have been to permanently
incapacitate magnussen so that they could

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:15.270
find a way to control the cybernetic implants
in his body.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:20.650
Question 12 - Sinup 34 asks do you think we’ll
ever learn what Augustus had on mary?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.019
No, I don’t think we were meant to.

00:04:22.019 --> 00:04:24.240
That’s what the burning of that hard drive
was all about.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.520
And really it was just all the people she
had killed and awful things she’d done while

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:32.750
she was working as a freelance hitman.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.110
Question 13 - Sarah Zmnia asks, how are magnussen
and moriarty connected.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.580
Is one controlling the other?

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:45.630
Just in the context of series 1 through three,
they’re just fellow business men.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:51.290
Magnussen probably knows about everything
moriarty ever did and moriarty probably had

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:54.100
snipers on magnussen all the time.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:05:00.760
But, Events during series 4 might change the
way we perceive their relationship.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:05.300
Question 14 - Olivia Obembe asks why do you
think the people in sherlock’s mind palace

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:11.560
during the middle of the episode were there?

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:14.820
The mind palace summons the most relevant
person for what sherlock needs.

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:18.430
Since molly was his most trusted medical professional,
she was the one that helped him first.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:21.920
Mycroft was kind of like purgatory, the transitional
state before he finally went into the land

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.920
of the dead.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.980
Moriarty was there to help him survive the
pain.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.840
He was so intense and seemed to thrive.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:32.100
So the mind palace conjured him up to learn
how he did it.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.740
Question 15 - Chelsea Parkin asks why did
magnussen mention mary’s family in the letter

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:37.740
at her wedding?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.733
He had probably been blackmailing mary her
whole life, so he knew she had no real family.

00:05:39.733 --> 00:05:43.370
He was just fucking with her like when he
was flicking watson’s eye.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:48.170
Question 16 - XBloodyDesiresX asks what do
you think about sherlock being a murderer

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.170
now?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.365
I think it’s totally within the character
to do something like that.

00:05:51.365 --> 00:05:53.320
Remember he’s a high functioning sociopath.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:58.410
So what’s the best way to get rid of all
those secrets when they only exist in magnussen.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.780
Just delete the hard drive.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:01.950
With a bullet.

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:07.670
Question 17 - Ambre Trongnez asks could you
explain the 221B door that flashed during

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.091
sherlock’s big mind palace sequence?

00:06:09.091 --> 00:06:10.091
That was just a representation of his life.

00:06:10.091 --> 00:06:11.091
The whole sequence was him trying to come
back to life.

00:06:11.091 --> 00:06:16.060
221B Baker street is a visual representation
of his life.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:20.390
Question 18 - Ether asks, does sherlock use
his patches to cover up a habit?

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:25.230
Jeanine had a right hand ring as do all the
clown gang members, do they all mean the same

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.230
thing?

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:31.540
I always imagine sherlock having tons of patches
everywhere, but if you’re talking about

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.441
using patches to cover up a heroin habit then
no I don’t think so.

00:06:34.441 --> 00:06:41.040
I think you were implying that he’d had
a habit this whole time, not just in this

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.040
episode.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:45.860
I don’t think that was the case, but I do
think he was high when molly slapped him.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.600
And the rings, that’s an awesome observation.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.570
We didn’t see much of the clown gang after
episode 2, so it’s possible that all those

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.970
rings are connected to something that will
manifest during series 4.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.400
At least that’s what I’m hoping.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:00.670
Question 19 - Vica Otrubina asks is sherlock
not a virgin anymore?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:05.010
Even though he was in that drug den for a
month it’s kind of implied he went back

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:07.639
and forth to 221B Baker street to be with
Janine.

00:07:07.639 --> 00:07:09.590
So yes, I do think they had sex.

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.710
The real question is was he high while they
were doing it.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:17.880
and question 20 last one - Megafluffz was
sherlock high at the beginning of the episode?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.900
He bends the truth a lot, but I think they
implied that he was.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.720
At least a little.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:23.150
I don’t think he would have actually gone
nutters.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.960
He was still working magnussen’s case the
whole time.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.900
He kind of confesses to mycroft that he was
high, but that he doesn’t keep drugs around

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:28.900
baker street.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:29.900
Thanks so much everyone for submitting your
questions.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:30.900
sorry I couldn’t answer them all.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:34.000
Like I said, I’m saving a lot of the post-credits
questions for my series 4 video.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.000
be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.730
I’m going to try and post it tomorrow night
when I post my episode 3 breakdown.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:37.730
But wednesday at the latest.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.570
I’ll also probably do a series 4 q and a
after that video too.

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.980
Don’t forget, this sunday I’m also starting
